  <cell width="340">
   <color r="255" g="248" b="178"><font name="Malgun Gothic" size="10">
    In Challenge and Campaign mode the leopard shark will be available when your zoo has reached 0.5 stars.  
   </font></color>
   <p /><font name="Malgun Gothic" size="10"> The leopard shark is a middle-length shark, who gets his name from the distinctive marks. These marks are brown with dark surroundings and placed on a light-brown body. He has powerful jaws and his teeth are slim and sharp. Leopard sharks catch different species of prey, but their skill is to track down prey who are hidden in the sand. They pull the prey with high speed from their hiding place.
</font><p /><font name="Malgun Gothic" size="10"> Like many shark pups, the leopard shark pups are born alive.
</font><p /><font name="Malgun Gothic" size="10"> The leopard shark lives along the west coast of North America. It grows up to 7 ft and weighs 15 lb. (32 kg.) His diet contains mainly fish, octopus and shellfish. 

</font></cell>
